bug_descriptions |bug_id, line_num, content|
    stage2_test_runner_libunit_project_name_missing_2026-11-27, 0, "Rust seed resolve_name_variants rebound text .slice(a, b) calls to compiler.frontend.core.types.str_slice (code-point s[a:b] instead of byte-offset rt_slice_text_bytes), causing _sdn_strip_leading_comment_lines on manifests with multi-byte UTF-8 comment chars ahead of project: to slice mid-token ('ect:') and fail library-unit dyn-lib packaging with 'project.name is missing'. Seed fix landed in 3850673f958 / merge af6ed58435c PR #12183 (src/compiler_rust/compiler/src/pipeline/native_project/imports.rs, gated by is_builtin_receiver_type); confirmed 2026-11-28 by rebuilt Stage 2 at pin f3cf72db4299 (test_runner_build library-unit packaging green); str_slice source workaround and 00.common manifest reorder both retired."

