    stage2_test_runner_libunit_project_name_missing_2026-11-27, 0, "2026-11-27 w6-3: registered orphan @workaround tag at src/compiler/10.frontend/core/types.spl:36-38 (str_slice -> s.substring); verified seed fix commit 3850673f958 on origin/release/1.0.0 gating resolve_name_variants lowercase-joined lookups by is_builtin_receiver_type in src/compiler_rust/compiler/src/pipeline/native_project/imports.rs (cargo test numeric_receiver_resolution_tests 7/7 cited); waiting-for: rebuilt Stage 2 passing test_runner_build end-to-end and retiring str_slice workaround."
    stage2_test_runner_libunit_project_name_missing_2026-11-27, 1, "2026-11-28 workaround-retire: rebuilt Stage 2 at bootstrap pin f3cf72db4299 (af6ed58435c is an ancestor, merge-base verified) ran test_runner_build with the exact pre-fix failure step green - '[library-unit-dynlib] units=4 reused=0 built=4' and 'phase=link state=succeeded' for simple_test_runner (build/bootstrap/pinned-src/pinned-f3cf72db4299/.simple/storage/build/bootstrap/stage2-compiler-tests/aarch64-unknown-linux-gnu/verification/logs/test_runner_build.log). Retired both workarounds: str_slice back to s[start:end_idx] (tag removed) and 00.common/simple.sdn back to the pre-#12111 essay-first layout (byte-identical to 94345282cdf, merge-base/diff verified). Interpreter checks: sdn_parser_spec 26/26, sdn_leading_comment_spec pass. Status -> verified; formal close deferred until a reproducer/prevention spec pair is attached (bug-close-evidence gate)."

